<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball-Results of Philippine pro league.</title>
<headline>Basketball-Results of Philippine pro league.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-08-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friday result of the second game in the final round of the Philippine Basketball Association second conference which includes one American import on each team:</p>
<p>Alaska Milk beat Formula Shell 93-86 (50-43)</p>
</text>
